  <FactionDef ParentName="RH2_FactionBase_141"> <!-- Определение фракции (FactionDef) -->
    <defName>RH2_141</defName> <!-- Уникальный идентификатор определения (Def) -->
    <label>special operations unit</label> <!-- Отображаемое наименование -->
    <description> <!-- Текстовое описание предмета, сущности или механики -->Task Force 141, commonly known as "The One-Four-One," is a highly skilled multinational special operations unit comprising military personnel from various nations with Special Forces backgrounds. Originally formed during the The Great Resistance War, the unit was authorized to recruit any qualified candidates they deemed necessary.

During the war, Task Force 141 was deployed to locate and destroy mechanoid communication systems responsible for calling in reinforcements from outside the planet. Despite valiant efforts, their progress was minimal and ultimately failed to prevent the invasion's devastating consequences.

Following this, an aerospace engineering company named "Orbital Vehicle and In-flight Dynamics" (OVID) discovered a hyperspace drive and used it to transport refugees to a distant, seemingly safe outer rim planet. However, upon arrival, Task Force 141 was tasked with destabilizing hostile factions by eliminating their leaders. With no end in sight, the unit has resorted to recruiting and training local fighters to help in their seemingly endless war.</description>
    <colorSpectrum> <!-- Цветовой спектр генерации -->
			<li>(87, 114, 205)</li> <!-- Элемент списка -->
			<li>(123,163,216)</li> <!-- Элемент списка -->
    </colorSpectrum>
	
